              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era Musengwa Katonda bweyabasindika okuva e Kadeshi Barinea ng'akoba ati, ‘Muje mutwale ensi ye mbaghaire’, mwadheemera ekiragiro kye. Musengwa Katonda waimwe timwamwesiga, waire okugondera ky'akoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
